### 12️⃣ Vista denormalizada

### (Join resuelto una sola vez)

```
trip + vendor + zone
        │
        ▼
vw_trip_denorm
```

### SQL (psql o JupySQL, indiferente)

```sql
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW vw_trip_denorm AS
SELECT
    t.trip_id,
    DATE(t.pickup_datetime)    AS pickup_date,
    EXTRACT(HOUR FROM t.pickup_datetime)::INT AS pickup_hour,
    t.trip_distance,
    t.total_amount,
    v.vendor_name,
    z.zone_name  AS pickup_zone,
    z.borough    AS pickup_borough
FROM curated.trip t
LEFT JOIN curated.vendor v
       ON t.vendor_id = v.vendor_id
LEFT JOIN curated.zone z
       ON t.pulocation_id = z.location_id;
```

### 🧠 Idea clave

```
El analista NO debería escribir joins complejos
si el modelo ya los conoce
```

